  "$comment": "The Brand wizard gallery, second source (Zoltan, 2026-10-02; docs/wizards/brand.md 12b): the design systems of open-design (Apache-2.0) at one pinned commit. scripts/fetch-library.mjs downloads each system manifest.json and tokens.css (nothing else: no DESIGN.md text, no logos, no fonts), checks each against opendesign.lock.json and bundles them with the repo LICENSE. runner/brand/tokens.mjs turns the tokens into Brand Identity Cards; brand fonts become their nearest shipped OFL font. Names are shown as \"<name> style\" with a note that the styles are not affiliated with the brands named.",
